type explicitly describes \"展示培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名\" - which is exactly what the user does NOT want.\n\nSo I should exclude all \"市场观察\" candidates.\n\nThe user wants content about databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. The relevant content types are:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - gives minimal reproduction scenarios and key logs, fault handling\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - explains state changes, concurrency order, resource boundaries\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - lists common concepts\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - organizes community activities, software development history, developer interviews, team collaboration and industry culture\n\nWait, the 专题观察 content type describes \"整理技术社区活动、软件发展沿革与开发者访谈，介绍团队协作背景和行业文化\" - this is more about community/industry culture, not really about database/concurrency/fault handling implementation. This seems less relevant to the user's interest in implementation and principles.\n\nThe user's interest: \"Java 后端工程，关注数据库、并发和服务故障处理的实现与原理\" - focuses on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles.\n\nSo the most relevant content types would be:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - directly about principles\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - about fault handling, reproduction scenarios, logs\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - concepts\n\nThe 专题观察 content is about community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture - less aligned with implementation/principles focus.\n\nThe 市场观察 content is explicitly excluded (training/cert/salary).\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need 20 total.\n\nLet me identify the topics that map to the user's interests:\n- 数据库 (databases): 慢查询, 组合索引, 连接池等待 (connection pool), 事务传播 (transaction propagation)\n- 并发 (concurrency): 并发更新, 线程池排队, 任务取消\n- 服务故障处理 (service fault handling): 缓存失效, 接口幂等, 消息重复\n\nAll topics are relevant to Java backend engineering.\n\nNow, given the user's focus on \"实现与原理\" (implementation and principles), the best content types are 条件与原理 and 操作记录. 概念速览 is also relevant as it provides concept overviews for further reading.\n\nLet me count how many candidates of each relevant type exist.\n\nLet me focus on selecting 20 candidates that are most relevant. Given the user's explicit focus on implementation and principles, and exclusion of market observation content.\n\nLet me count the \"条件与原理\" candidates (these are most aligned with \"原理\"):\nLooking through the list, I'll identify them by title containing \"条件与原理\".\n\nLet me count candidates with \"条件与原理\":\n1. item-07ad7c7c66a5 任务取消：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n2. item-167782abe824 事务传播：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n3. item-17c3bb0307b5 并发更新：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n4. item-20bfb5d44845 连接池等待：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n5. item-31156631e3f2 接口幂等：社区服务中的条件与原理\n6. item-3494031e73f0 接口幂等：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n7. item-3a036e513cc4 消息重复：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n8. item-3b6e33dce189 事务传播：社区服务中的条件与原理\n9. item-484f44814a6c 连接池等待：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n10. item-48bbae8e6847 接口幂等：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n11. item-493d69ea1678 事务传播：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n12. item-499e6590050c 组合索引：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n13. item-501f16c5db37 任务取消：社区服务中的条件与原理\n14. item-597155538375 并发更新：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n15. item-5ccc33f5cce3 线程池排队：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n16. item-67b5a18f0547 慢查询：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n17. item-689a5fa763fa 线程池排队：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n18. item-69fcb931e4f0 线程池排队：社区服务中的条件与原理\n19. item-6a8ebd95afce 任务取消：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n20. item-7c1df1bd80e8 组合索引：社区服务中的条件与原理\n21. item-7c516d820df3 缓存失效：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n22. item-7f9f61e579f1 并发更新：社区服务中的条件与原理\n23. item-828574c50a12 连接池等待：社区服务中的条件与原理\n24. item-92afb9de99a6 并发更新：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n25. item-949080fa218b 缓存失效：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n26. item-96cdcb6aadff 任务取消：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n27. item-a5c084a7c3f9 线程池排队：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n28. item-ad229eb8a513 组合索引：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n29. item-b1d3423b2f36 慢查询：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n30. item-b537ef38be29 连接池等待：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n31. item-b87fddb84f01 缓存失效：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n32. item-c83d92b719ae 慢查询：社区服务中的条件与原理\n33. item-d18bf4b0474f 事务传播：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n34. item-df7e0f3bfa24 消息重复：社区服务中的条件与原理\n35. item-e09